+/**
+ * EDTP deviation WD-10. Not upstream.
+ *
+ * Reads a `LoTELegalNotice` written as a multilingual character string — `{"value": …, "lang": …}`,
+ * which is how ETSI TS 119 602 V1.1.1 clause 6.3.11 describes it — as well as the plain string this
+ * model and the JSON schema bundled with it expect, and keeps the text. Without it a list carrying
+ * a multilingual legal notice does not parse at all, so none of its trust anchors is loaded.
+ *
+ * The property stays a `String`, so the class is unchanged for everything compiled against it.
+ */
